entation, respectively. f, NSG mice received intravenous injections of \( 5\!\times\!10^{5} \) Raji lymphoma cells expressing ffLuc (day 0). Seven days later, mice were treated with \( 5\!\times\!10^{6} \) CD19 CAR T cells or non-transfected control T cells and imaged at the indicated time points. A summary of luminescence signals (left) and images of individual mice (right) are displayed.
